        <terms:created rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2026-07-02T00:42:45Z</terms:created>
        <terms:description>Trigeminal neuralgia pain typically presents as paroxysmal, electric shock-like attacks and sometimes accompanied by concomitant continuous pain.</terms:description>
